+<!-- rnb-text-begin -->
+<p>Specify the tissue of interest, run the boilerplate code which sets up the functions and environment, load the tissue object.</p>
+<!-- rnb-text-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-begin -->
+<!-- rnb-source-begin eyJkYXRhIjoiYGBgclxudGlzc3VlX29mX2ludGVyZXN0ID0gXCJNdXNjbGVcIlxubGlicmFyeShoZXJlKVxuc291cmNlKGhlcmUoXCIwMF9kYXRhX2luZ2VzdFwiLCBcIjAyX3Rpc3N1ZV9hbmFseXNpc19ybWRcIiwgXCJib2lsZXJwbGF0ZS5SXCIpKVxudGlzcyA8LSBsb2FkX3Rpc3N1ZV9kcm9wbGV0KHRpc3N1ZV9vZl9pbnRlcmVzdClcbmBgYCJ9 -->
+<pre class="r"><code>tissue_of_interest = &quot;Muscle&quot;
+library(here)
+source(here(&quot;00_data_ingest&quot;, &quot;02_tissue_analysis_rmd&quot;, &quot;boilerplate.R&quot;))
+tiss &lt;- load_tissue_droplet(tissue_of_interest)</code></pre>
+<!-- rnb-source-end -->
+<!-- rnb-output-begin eyJkYXRhIjoiUGVyZm9ybWluZyBsb2ctbm9ybWFsaXphdGlvblxuMCUgICAxMCAgIDIwICAgMzAgICA0MCAgIDUwICAgNjAgICA3MCAgIDgwICAgOTAgICAxMDAlXG5bLS0tLXwtLS0tfC0tLS18LS0tLXwtLS0tfC0tLS18LS0tLXwtLS0tfC0tLS18LS0tLXxcbioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqKioqfFxuIn0= -->
